<section class="grid gap-4 sm:gap-6 lg:grid-cols-3">
  <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 shadow-sm sm:p-6 lg:col-span-2">
    <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-sky-700">Dashboard de Entrega</p>
    <h1 class="mt-2 text-2xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-3xl">Aplicacion web con autenticacion de usuarios</h1>
    <p class="mt-3 text-slate-600">Este panel valida lo pedido en el ejercicio: autenticacion nativa, contrasenas encriptadas, recuperacion de cuenta y configuracion de Action Mailer.</p>

    <div class="mt-6 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2">
      <% @exercise_checks.each do |check| %>
        <article class="rounded-xl border p-4 <%= check[:ok] ? 'border-emerald-200 bg-emerald-50/70' : 'border-amber-200 bg-amber-50/70' %>">
          <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3">
            <h2 class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900"><%= check[:title] %></h2>
            <span class="rounded-full px-2 py-1 text-xs font-semibold <%= check[:ok] ? 'bg-emerald-200 text-emerald-900' : 'bg-amber-200 text-amber-900' %>">
              <%= check[:ok] ? 'OK' : 'Pendiente' %>
            </span>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-600"><%= check[:detail] %></p>
        </article>
      <% end %>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
      <%= link_to "Iniciar sesion", new_session_path, class: "rounded-md bg-sky-700 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:bg-sky-600" %>
      <%= link_to "Crear cuenta", new_registration_path, class: "rounded-md border border-slate-300 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-50" %>
      <%= link_to "Recuperar contrasena", new_password_path, class: "rounded-md border border-slate-300 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-50" %>
    </div>
  </div>

  <aside class="space-y-4 sm:space-y-6">
    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm">
      <h2 class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-500">Estado de sesion</h2>
      <% if authenticated? %>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-700">Usuario autenticado:</p>
        <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900"><%= Current.user.email_address %></p>
        <div class="mt-4">
          <%= button_to "Cerrar sesion", session_path, method: :delete, class: "w-full rounded-md bg-slate-900 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:bg-slate-700" %>
        </div>
      <% else %>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-600">No hay una sesion activa en este momento.</p>
      <% end %>
    </div>

    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm">
      <h2 class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-500">Evidencia de cifrado</h2>
      <dl class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-sm">
        <div class="flex justify-between gap-3">
          <dt class="text-slate-600">Usuarios totales</dt>
          <dd class="font-semibold text-slate-900"><%= @users_total_count %></dd>
        </div>
        <div class="flex justify-between gap-3">
          <dt class="text-slate-600">Con password_digest</dt>
          <dd class="font-semibold text-slate-900"><%= @users_with_digest_count %></dd>
        </div>
      </dl>

      <% if @recent_users.any? %>
        <h3 class="mt-4 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-500">Ultimos usuarios</h3>
        <ul class="mt-2 space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-700">
          <% @recent_users.each do |user| %>
            <li class="rounded-md border border-slate-200 px-3 py-2">
              <div class="font-medium text-slate-900"><%= user.email_address %></div>
              <div class="text-xs text-slate-500">digest: <%= user.password_digest.to_s.first(18) %>...</div>
            </li>
          <% end %>
        </ul>
      <% end %>
    </div>

    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm">
      <h2 class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-500">Correo de recuperacion (Brevo)</h2>

      <div class="mt-3 flex items-center justify-between gap-3 rounded-md border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 px-3 py-2 text-sm">
        <span class="text-slate-600">Proveedor actual</span>
        <span class="font-semibold uppercase text-slate-900"><%= @smtp_provider %></span>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-3 flex items-center justify-between gap-3 rounded-md border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 px-3 py-2 text-sm">
        <span class="text-slate-600">Envio asincrono en produccion</span>
        <span class="font-semibold text-emerald-700"><%= @mail_async_in_production ? "Activo" : "Inactivo" %></span>
      </div>

      <h3 class="mt-4 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-500">Como probar</h3>
      <ol class="mt-2 list-decimal space-y-1 pl-5 text-sm text-slate-600">
        <li>Abre <strong>Recuperar contrasena</strong> e ingresa un correo registrado.</li>
        <li>Espera unos segundos: el envio se procesa en background para que la pagina no se ponga lenta.</li>
        <li>Revisa Inbox/Spam en Gmail del destinatario.</li>
      </ol>

      <p class="mt-3 rounded-md bg-slate-100 px-3 py-2 text-xs text-slate-700">
        Tip: para Render usa SMTP_PROVIDER=brevo, SMTP_FROM verificado y BREVO_API_KEY para fallback por API.
      </p>
    </div>
  </aside>
</section>
